  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ベンガルガキ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%99%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%AB%E3%82%AC%E3%82%AD",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 107844496,
      "text": "ベンガルガキ (あるいはインドガキ、ナンヨウガキ）は、インド、スリランカ、バングラデシュ、東南アジアを原産地とするカキノキ科の被子植物である。常緑高木である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Diospyros malabarica",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diospyros_malabarica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1363378540,
      "text": "Diospyros malabarica, the gaub tree, Malabar ebony, black-and-white ebony or pale moon ebony, is a species of flowering tree in the family Ebenaceae that is native to the Indian subcontinent and South East Asia."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Diospyros malabarica",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diospyros_malabarica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 173939939,
      "text": "Diospyros malabarica es una especie de árbol perteneciente a la familia Ebenaceae que es nativo del subcontinente indio y el sudeste de Asia."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Culiket",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Culiket",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 28701179,
      "text": "Eboni Malabar atau Pala Bulan adalah sejenis pohon anggota suku eboni-ebonian atau Ebenaceae. Nama lainnya adalah culiket (Sunda), klécå/klégå/kledung (Jawa), kumun/komoi (Melayu), makusi, toyokuku, dan gaub."
    }
